

FANTCION Setimage EXPACTE dir EQUAL ""
    RETURN Titlbar EQUAL Frame WITH on shap x y width hight

FANTCION Titlbar EXPACTE on EQUAL FOCESD shap EQUAL 'rectangel' x EQUAL 0 y EQUAL 0 width EQUAL 100 hight EQUAL 100 
    RETURN Titlbar EQUAL Frame WITH on shap x y width hight
    
FANTCION Exitbutton EXPACTE shap EQUAL 'rectangel' x EQUAL 0 y EQUAL 0 width EQUAL 100 hight EQUAL 100 Titlbar EQUAL TRUE isExitbut EQUAL TRUE isMinbut EQUAL TRUE  
    Exitbut EQUAL Button WITH Titlbar 'rectangel' x y width hight 
    
FANTCION Maximaizbutton EXPACTE shap EQUAL 'rectangel' x EQUAL 0 y EQUAL 0 width EQUAL 100 hight EQUAL 100 Titlbar EQUAL TRUE isExitbut EQUAL TRUE isMinbut EQUAL TRUE  
    Minbut EQUAL Button WITH Titlbar 'rectangel' x y width hight 
    
FANTCION Minmaizbutton EXPACTE shap EQUAL 'rectangel' x EQUAL 0 y EQUAL 0 width EQUAL 100 hight EQUAL 100 Titlbar EQUAL TRUE isExitbut EQUAL TRUE isMinbut EQUAL TRUE  
    Minbut EQUAL Button WITH Titlbar 'rectangel' x y width hight 
    
FANTCION MAIN EXPACTE shap EQUAL 'rectangel' x EQUAL 0 y EQUAL 0 width EQUAL 100 hight EQUAL 100 Titlbar EQUAL TRUE isExitbut EQUAL TRUE isMinbut EQUAL TRUE  
    win EQUAL Draw WITH Shap x y width hight SCREEN
    IF isTitlbar  EQUAL  TRUE 
       Titlbar WITH win shap x y width hight
    
    IF isExitbut EQUAL TRUE 
         
    IF isMinbut EQUAL TRUE 
        
    RETURN win
